          "body": "Salesforce is currently experiencing a major service disruption impacting multiple instances across all regions, we're aware that some customers are currently unable to raise cases, contact support, use in-app help or access Xero Central. We're investigating this with Salesforce as a priority. Please note, this does not impact your access to the Xero platform.\n\nOur teams are actively monitoring the situation. We are in direct contact with Salesforce, who are treating this as a critical incident and working to restore services as quickly as possible. We will share further updates as the situation develops.",
